            "review_title": "Review at Rainbow Cafe",
            "review_text": "Frank G\nFrankfurt, Germany231 contributions\n0\nNice place for a quick bite and/or a drink\nApr 2018 • Couples\nThe place is located just opposite the Sunline Hotel where we stayed. Very convenient for a second breakfast, a bite in the afternoon, or just a drink.\nStaff are very friendly and speak english quite well.\nThe food was good, my girlriend ate mostly Thai food, I had a vietnamese sandwich.\nPrices are reasonable. They have some tables outside, which we always preferred as you can do some people-watching, too.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 14, 2018",
